/* THE ONE PANEL THEME. Every PanelSettings points here, so theme.uss is the default style of every
 * panel and nothing else is a theme (Sam, 2026-09-30). Unity's default theme is NOT imported: the
 * controls this project renders get their structure from controls.uss, which theme.uss imports.
 * A new control type needs a block in controls.uss. */
@import url("/Assets/UI/Common/theme.uss");
